---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
import Ola from '../../components/Ola.astro';
---

<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden pt-14 pb-16 sm:pt-20 sm:pb-24">
  <!-- Subtle radial glow, top-left, like contacto -->
  <div
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[radial-gradient(60%_50%_at_15%_25%,rgba(250,222,170,0.08),transparent_70%)]"
  ></div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <!-- Eyebrow -->
    <div class="reveal flex items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4">
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-10 bg-arena sm:w-16"></span>
      <span class="font-display text-xs tracking-[0.4em] text-arena uppercase sm:text-sm">
        Colabora con SLPH
      </span>
    </div>

    <!-- Headline: question with playful "aleta" highlight -->
    <h1 class="reveal reveal-delay-1 mt-6 max-w-4xl font-display text-[clamp(2.5rem,7.5vw,5rem)] leading-[0.95] tracking-tight text-caparol">
      ¿Nos echas
      <span class="whitespace-nowrap">
        una
        <span class="relative inline-block text-arena italic">
          aleta
          <!-- Tiny fin doodle riding above the word -->
          <svg
            class="anim-float-soft pointer-events-none absolute -top-7 -right-5 h-6 w-6 text-arena sm:-top-9 sm:-right-7 sm:h-8 sm:w-8"
            viewBox="0 0 40 40"
            fill="currentColor"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path d="M6 34 Q 12 18 24 8 Q 34 2 36 6 Q 34 22 24 30 Q 14 36 6 34 Z" />
          </svg>
        </span>
      </span>?
    </h1>

    <!-- Lead — the "deber moral / supervivencia" punch -->
    <p class="reveal reveal-delay-2 mt-8 max-w-3xl font-display text-xl leading-tight text-celeste sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl">
      Preservar nuestros mares y sus ecosistemas
      <span class="text-caparol">no es solo un deber moral</span>:
      <Ola class="text-arena">¡nuestra supervivencia depende de ello!</Ola>
    </p>

    <!-- Body paragraphs -->
    <div class="reveal reveal-delay-3 mt-10 grid max-w-3xl gap-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-caparol/90 sm:text-lg">
      <p>
        Por esa razón <em class="not-italic font-display text-arena">Si los peces hablaran…</em>
        busca promover conciencia en la protección del medioambiente
        en <span class="text-celeste">todas las edades</span>, tanto de forma particular
        como de la mano de instituciones y empresas.
      </p>
      <p>
        Si quieres ayudar a nuestros mares y eres una persona particular,
        puedes empezar con labores sencillas:
        <span class="font-display text-arena">reciclar y reutilizar</span>.
        En nuestro blog y redes sociales solemos proponer ideas para reducir tu huella ecológica,
        <Ola>¡así que no dejes de seguirnos!</Ola>
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick CTA strip toward socials / blog -->
    <div class="reveal reveal-delay-4 mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-sm text-caparol/80">
      <a
        href="/noticias"
        class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-display tracking-wide text-arena uppercase transition hover:text-caparol"
      >
        <Icon name="game-icons:newspaper" class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true" />
        Lee el blog
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="hidden h-4 w-px bg-caparol/25 sm:inline-block"></span>
      <a
        href="https://www.instagram.com/silospeceshablaran"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-display tracking-wide text-celeste uppercase transition hover:text-caparol"
      >
        <Icon name="simple-icons:instagram" class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true" />
        Síguenos en Instagram
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Delfín. Das Asset ist hochformatig (604x1000): die Blasenspur nimmt die
         obere Hälfte ein, der Körper die untere.
         Mobil steht er im Fluss unter dem CTA-Strip, rechtsbündig bis an den
         Viewport-Rand (-mr-6 hebt das px-6 des Containers auf) und ragt unten
         ins Section-Padding.
         Ab lg verlässt er den Fluss und sitzt rechts neben dem Text; der Anker
         liegt weit oben, damit der Delfín selbst auf Höhe des Leads landet und
         die Blasen an der Headline vorbeisteigen. -->
    <img
      src="/assets/animals/dolphin.webp"
      alt=""
      aria-hidden="true"
      class="anim-float-soft pointer-events-none -mt-2 -mr-6 -mb-10 ml-auto block w-40 drop-shadow-[0_18px_28px_rgba(6,15,44,0.45)] sm:-mb-16 sm:w-52 md:w-64 lg:absolute lg:top-6 lg:right-2 lg:-z-10 lg:m-0 lg:w-52 xl:right-4 xl:w-72"
      width="604"
      height="1000"
      loading="lazy"
    />
  </div>
</section>
